  "description": "Records every drive in the background and keeps its numbers: distance, time moving, top speed, best 0-60 mph, peak rpm, the most acceleration, braking and cornering g, and the highest oil and coolant temperatures. This drive, History, and Save CSV for the whole log. Read-only: it only listens to the car's driving signals. Starts with the car.",
